SUMMARY
Direct Qwen q+gate/k/v projection width is incompatible with dedicated QKV split/create ops.
Using those ops requires first slicing away Q gate and concatenating a standard QKV tensor.
Dedicated concat-head ops either add an extra op or require L1 sharding/layout roundtrips.
Adapted generalized_moe_gate routing reaches the required sharded layout,
but this Blackhole checkout cannot JIT its kernel because a required LLK header is missing.
